cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the repository version and commit used. This is an exploratory research model, not a new proof of the Four-Color Theorem."
title: "Four-Color Edge Recursion: Plane-Map Boundary Signatures and V4 Flow Repair"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Qinzi27"
    website: "https://github.com/Qinzi27"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-06
repository-code: "https://github.com/Qinzi27/four-color-edge-recursion"
url: "https://github.com/Qinzi27/four-color-edge-recursion"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible research foundation for recursive left/right face-color
  descriptions of plane maps, complete boundary extension relations,
  and exact minimum-change Klein-four-group flow repair on two-terminal
  series-parallel networks. Includes elementary proofs, executable
  reference implementations, examples, and independent finite checks.
keywords:
  - four-color theorem
  - plane maps
  - planar graphs
  - edge-side coloring
  - boundary signatures
  - Klein four-group
  - nowhere-zero flows
  - recursive decomposition
